<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Coelba 1996 loss deepens.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Coelba 1996 loss deepens.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bahia state power distributor Coelba, whose privatization is expected in July, issued the following statement on its 1996 results.</p>
<p>		1996			   1995</p>
<p>    Shr loss  22.97 reais	 Loss  23.62 reais</p>
<p>    Loss	250.6 million     Loss  169.8 million</p>
<p>    Net revs  644.2 million	     461.4 million</p>
<p>NOTE: All data in Brazilian reais.</p>
<p>Share figures provided per lot of 1,000 shares.  </p>
<p>Coelba, the country's sixth largest power company, hopes to release tender documents for its sale in June, it said.</p>
<p>((-- Romina Nicaretta, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248 5415))</p>
</text>
